    {
      "id": "e476b61f-a1d3-4708-a6d3-054abf25e007",
      "name": "Sticky Note e476b61f",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Receptionist (Website Chat)\n\nA chat widget that answers questions from your business profile, saves visitors to HubSpot, checks real calendar availability and books meetings with a calendar invite. When it is unsure, or the visitor asks for a person, it hands off to your team in Slack.\n\n**Guardrails:** answers only from the profile, never quotes prices, no legal or tax advice, always confirms the slot before booking.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit **Business Profile** (name, time zone, hours, FAQ)\n2. Connect Anthropic, Google Calendar, HubSpot, Slack and Google Sheets\n3. Pick your calendar in both calendar tools\n4. Activate, then embed the chat on your site with the `@n8n/chat` snippet (see README)",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14b7d822-970d-4bf3-a683-cda8b378452e",
      "name": "Sticky Note 14b7d822",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Receptionist\nThe agent uses memory per chat session and four tools. Replies stream straight to the widget.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 768,
        "height": 224
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6b7c5422-6033-473e-9f37-4694d441d292",
      "name": "Sticky Note 6b7c5422",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        208
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Chat log\nEvery visitor message is logged on a parallel branch, so logging never delays or breaks the reply.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 160,
        "height": 224
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9e327e8e-b057-4cd3-bcfa-200c34d20883",
